HN\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"neutral\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Billions in revenue just before your IPO isn't a bad deal either\",\n        \"source\": \"HN\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 3.3 Bug Fixes\",\n    \"description\": \"May 6, 2026 update (v3.3) fixed various cloud agent timing and hydration edge cases affecting reliability, plus performance improvements.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"bugfix\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/cn/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-06\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Windsurf\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 2.2.17 with Devin Review and Quick Review\",\n    \"description\": \"May 6, 2026 release (v2.2.17) makes Devin Review & Quick Review available to all users, improves Agent Command Center, fixes Windows bugs, and enhances MCP server and Devin Local agent reliability.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://windsurf.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-06\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"Analytics Governance Documentation Update\",\n    \"description\": \"May 6, 2026 update to Codex enterprise governance guide with more detailed coverage of Analytics dashboard charts, data export options, and enterprise Analytics API endpoints.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"documentation\",\n    \"url\": \"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-06\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Model Controls, Spend Management, and Usage Analytics for Enterprise\",\n    \"description\": \"May 4, 2026 release introduces model controls for enterprise users, spend management tools, and usage analytics dashboard targeting Enterprise admins.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-04\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 0.128.0 with Goal Workflows and Permission Profiles\",\n    \"description\": \"April 30, 2026 release (v0.128.0) adds persisted /goal workflows with app-server APIs, permission profiles with built-in defaults, expanded plugin management with marketplace installation, and external agent session import.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-30\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"Agentic Workflows in Visual Studio\",\n    \"description\": \"April 30, 2026 update focuses on agentic workflows with cloud agent sessions launching directly from IDE and enhanced custom agent capabilities.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-30-github-copilot-in-visual-studio-april-update/\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-30\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  }\n]\n"
}

